Components the ESP32-P4 panel build fetches
-------------------------------------------

The panel firmware for the ESP32-P4 reaches the board's ESP32-C6 radio
through components from the Espressif component registry. They are not in
this repository: firmware/panel/dependencies.lock names them with their
hashes, and a build downloads them into firmware/panel/managed_components/.
A panel image contains their compiled code.

